{"id":"excepto","lemma":"excepto","pos":"prep","rank":763,"glosses":["except"],"ipa":"/e(ɡ)ˈθebto/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-excepto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Todos sonrieron excepto Tom.","en":"Everybody but Tom smiled.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/194346"},{"text":"Todos se fueron excepto nosotros.","en":"Everyone went except us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735093"},{"text":"Haré cualquier cosa excepto eso.","en":"I will do anything but that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703614"},{"text":"Nadie es perfecto, excepto yo.","en":"No one's perfect, except me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/694518"},{"text":"Todos excepto Tom parecen asustados.","en":"Everyone looks scared but Tom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333775"}]}